00:12:47.032 --> 00:12:48.243
Really?

00:12:48.267 --> 00:12:50.512
In other words, you're saying
that Ran changed

00:12:50.536 --> 00:12:54.883
because of the game machine that's
supposed to grant your wishes?

00:12:54.907 --> 00:12:56.033
It's suspicious.

00:12:56.642 --> 00:13:00.510
But Ran was her usual self until
we came in here. Right, Aya?

00:13:02.081 --> 00:13:04.893
It said your wish would come true

00:13:04.917 --> 00:13:06.885
if you won stickers with golden frames.

00:13:07.586 --> 00:13:09.631
| know it was real.

00:13:09.655 --> 00:13:11.399
Say, Ran...

00:13:11.423 --> 00:13:12.534
She's not here!

00:13:12.558 --> 00:13:14.669
What?! You were closest to her!

00:13:14.693 --> 00:13:16.661
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:13:30.176 --> 00:13:32.187
It's no good, I couldn't find her.

00:13:32.211 --> 00:13:34.179
She isn't around here.

00:13:34.547 --> 00:13:35.590
What about her cell?

00:13:35.614 --> 00:13:37.492
| can't get a connection.

00:13:37.516 --> 00:13:39.143
Oh, Ran?

00:13:40.219 --> 00:13:41.363
Oh, dear Miyu?

00:13:41.387 --> 00:13:44.049
Don't "dear Miyu" me! Why did you
have your cell turned off?!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:48.937
Well, good manners dictate that you
turn your cell phone off on the train.

00:13:48.961 --> 00:13:50.672
Train?!

00:13:50.696 --> 00:13:52.607
Ran, where are you right now?!

00:13:52.631 --> 00:13:54.176
| am on my way to the bookstore.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.168
So, where the hell are you?!

00:13:56.936 --> 00:13:58.870
What?! Ikebukuro?!

00:13:59.405 --> 00:14:00.873
Mami Honda's territory.

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:03.919
Anyway, I'm going to go get her!

00:14:03.943 --> 00:14:05.921
You guys find the sticker machine!

00:14:05.945 --> 00:14:07.689
You just leave that up to us, topknot!

00:14:07.713 --> 00:14:10.292
Come on, it's okay, right?
Let us take your picture.

00:14:10.316 --> 00:14:11.693
| cannot...

00:14:11.717 --> 00:14:14.563
It's rare to see that kind
of cosplay these days.

00:14:14.587 --> 00:14:16.783
We'll get you into magazines too.

00:14:18.123 --> 00:14:19.968
The hell do you do that for?!

00:14:19.992 --> 00:14:22.804
You dare to pass over the great Mami Honda

00:14:22.828 --> 00:14:25.297
and interview someone else in Bukuro?!

00:14:25.865 --> 00:14:27.175
Sorry, Mami!

00:14:27.199 --> 00:14:30.111
Damn it, guys that harass girls
for a date are just scum.

00:14:30.135 --> 00:14:35.301
Thank you so very much, Miss Mami Honda
and Miss Harue Kudoh.

00:14:36.242 --> 00:14:37.505
Good afternoon.

00:14:38.611 --> 00:14:41.289
Kotobuki! What the hell are you
doing in Bukuro?!

00:14:41.313 --> 00:14:43.892
If you're looking for a fight, I'll take
you on! Don't be a chicken!

00:14:43.916 --> 00:14:44.759
Mami...

00:14:44.783 --> 00:14:46.774
| came to buy reference books.

00:14:47.419 --> 00:14:48.730
A sticker game machine?

00:14:48.754 --> 00:14:50.632
Oh, it wasn't very popular.

00:14:50.656 --> 00:14:52.801
We had the dealer take it back just now,

00:14:52.825 --> 00:14:54.793
so it's probably going to get scrapped.

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:57.906
What'll we do?

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.609
If they take it to the scrap factory,
it'll be a pancake.

00:15:00.633 --> 00:15:02.244
Oh, my god!

00:15:02.268 --> 00:15:04.045
But we just have to find it.

00:15:04.069 --> 00:15:07.048
We wouldn't be in this trouble
if we could find it so easily!

00:15:07.072 --> 00:15:08.984
Found it.

00:15:09.008 --> 00:15:10.252
Both of you, hurry up!

00:15:10.276 --> 00:15:12.040
Come on, let's go!

00:15:19.385 --> 00:15:22.731
What the heck is up with Kotobuki?

00:15:22.755 --> 00:15:24.900
Rather than a gal, that's more like...

00:15:24.924 --> 00:15:26.768
A debutante?

00:15:26.792 --> 00:15:28.303
No way!

00:15:28.327 --> 00:15:30.489
Does that mean she knows
who I really am?

00:15:32.564 --> 00:15:36.511
All right, I'll test just how much of
a debutante Ran Kotobuki is!

00:15:36.535 --> 00:15:38.765
Mami, calm down.

00:15:39.371 --> 00:15:41.082
We've finally caught you red-handed!

00:15:41.106 --> 00:15:43.131
We have discovered a friend of the alien!

00:15:43.809 --> 00:15:46.506
You two sisters both out to
pick a fight with Bukuro?

00:15:49.415 --> 00:15:51.893
Sayo, dear, you should not play pranks.

00:15:51.917 --> 00:15:53.795
We're out of power,
Detective Kotobuki!

00:15:53.819 --> 00:15:55.697
We'll have to retreat for now, datchu!

00:15:55.721 --> 00:15:57.689
You two shut the hell up!

00:15:58.624 --> 00:15:59.968
Kotobuki!

00:15:59.992 --> 00:16:03.171
You will accept the
debutante showdown

00:16:03.195 --> 00:16:05.073
<i>against the great Mami Honda!</i>

00:16:05.097 --> 00:16:06.861
How exciting, datchu.

00:16:08.334 --> 00:16:08.677
Art

00:16:08.701 --> 00:16:09.930
Art
Showdown number one.

00:16:12.137 --> 00:16:14.003
Ah, tres bien!

00:16:17.009 --> 00:16:19.603
Ouil Art is explosiveness!

00:16:20.713 --> 00:16:20.822
Spirit of
Harmony

00:16:20.846 --> 00:16:21.990
Spirit of Harmony
Showdown number two.

00:16:22.014 --> 00:16:22.924
Showdown number two.

00:16:22.948 --> 00:16:24.643
Quite a skilled arrangement.

00:16:27.353 --> 00:16:29.097
Please make me your pupil!

00:16:29.121 --> 00:16:30.020
What?!

00:16:30.489 --> 00:16:30.598
Music

00:16:30.622 --> 00:16:31.783
Music
Showdown number three.

00:16:49.241 --> 00:16:50.685
Grrr!

00:16:50.709 --> 00:16:53.679
Damn it, I will expose her
for the fraud that she is!

00:16:56.281 --> 00:16:57.659
Where did it go?

00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:59.651
We lost sight of it.

00:17:00.586 --> 00:17:01.429
Rei!

00:17:01.453 --> 00:17:04.184
Otohata, did you see a truck with
a game machine in the back?

00:17:04.723 --> 00:17:06.555
You mean that one that
| just passed by?

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:13.742
Second Place, Tatsukichi,
hurry up and get on!

00:17:13.766 --> 00:17:15.210
Wait, please!

00:17:15.234 --> 00:17:16.759
Thanks, Rei!

00:17:25.277 --> 00:17:27.122
Go ahead, don't hesitate and eat.

00:17:27.146 --> 00:17:29.057
It's on us today.

00:17:29.081 --> 00:17:30.892
Thank you for your kindness.

00:17:30.916 --> 00:17:32.460
Hey, it's ESP-er Satoh!

00:17:32.484 --> 00:17:33.349
What?!

00:17:33.819 --> 00:17:34.342
«— Tabasco «— Mustard

00:17:37.823 --> 00:17:39.434
Who might that be?

00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:41.836
| only watch educational
programs on TV,

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.589
so I am rather ignorant of
popular entertainers.

00:17:44.263 --> 00:17:46.474
Maybe it was just me.
Please, go right ahead.

00:17:46.498 --> 00:17:48.009
Yes, thank you.

00:17:48.033 --> 00:17:52.334
This is the end of your
goody-goody debutante act.

00:17:55.574 --> 00:17:57.269
It is very delicious.

00:18:04.016 --> 00:18:07.062
Hey, Kotobuki, we'll leave it
at that for today!

00:18:07.086 --> 00:18:08.781
Just you remember this!

00:18:09.788 --> 00:18:11.256
Oh, Ran!

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:12.567
Dear Miyu!

00:18:12.591 --> 00:18:14.335
Ran, are you okay?

00:18:14.359 --> 00:18:17.294
Miss Mami Honda was kind enough
to treat me to lunch.

00:18:17.629 --> 00:18:20.257
Anyway, let's hurry up and go find Aya.

00:18:21.667 --> 00:18:23.499
Taxi!

00:18:23.735 --> 00:18:25.294
Come on, get in, Ran!

00:18:26.505 --> 00:18:29.350
Assistant Inspector Yamazaki,
we have secured the suspect, chu!

00:18:29.374 --> 00:18:30.919
Hurry up and get in!

00:18:30.943 --> 00:18:32.536
Sayo...

00:18:33.912 --> 00:18:35.539
Off we go!

00:18:37.516 --> 00:18:39.211
Aya, Yuya, and Game Machine
Tatsuki's Taxi 1

00:18:39.818 --> 00:18:41.830
How far are they going with it?

00:18:41.854 --> 00:18:43.822
It's the industrial road running
along Tokyo Bay.

00:18:44.423 --> 00:18:45.891
Okay, got it!

00:18:46.892 --> 00:18:49.838
They got a hold of Ran! They're
heading this way on the double!

00:18:49.862 --> 00:18:52.991
All right, baby! Now, Ran-pyon
can go back to being herself!

00:18:56.702 --> 00:18:59.080
Don't mess with me!

00:18:59.104 --> 00:19:00.682
Don't be such a brat!

00:19:00.706 --> 00:19:03.518
You gotta have fun while
you've got the chance!

00:19:03.542 --> 00:19:05.186
| said, let her go!

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:07.372
That's an ironclad rule for gals!

00:19:09.615 --> 00:19:11.392
Ook? What's going on?

00:19:11.416 --> 00:19:13.646
Ook!

00:19:15.654 --> 00:19:17.315
This is bad! There's a traffic jam!

00:19:18.357 --> 00:19:19.984
We'll lose sight of it!

00:19:24.196 --> 00:19:25.907
<i>Otohata!</i>

00:19:25.931 --> 00:19:27.408
We are ju-, ju-

00:19:27.432 --> 00:19:29.544
Junior detectives!!

00:19:29.568 --> 00:19:30.812
Datchu!

00:19:30.836 --> 00:19:32.133
Sayo, that's enough already.

00:19:37.142 --> 00:19:38.667
There it is! Please stop here!

00:19:40.112 --> 00:19:40.772
Safety First

00:19:43.415 --> 00:19:44.905
<i>Otohata!</i>

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.251
There's got to be a power
switch somewhere!

00:20:01.166 --> 00:20:02.827
Up we go!

00:20:14.046 --> 00:20:16.324
Ook! Found it, yay!

00:20:16.348 --> 00:20:17.873
Ook!

00:20:22.254 --> 00:20:23.983
<i>Otohata!</i>

00:20:25.424 --> 00:20:27.051
We're here, datchu!

00:20:27.993 --> 00:20:31.088
Dear Miyu, dear Aya, where are we?

00:20:31.363 --> 00:20:32.574
What are we doing?

00:20:32.598 --> 00:20:33.775
Don't worry about all that.

00:20:33.799 --> 00:20:37.378
You just have to stand here and
wish to get back to normal.

00:20:37.402 --> 00:20:39.347
Get back to normal?

00:20:39.371 --> 00:20:40.615
Why?

00:20:40.639 --> 00:20:42.150
Good grief.

00:20:42.174 --> 00:20:44.018
Forcing her would be...

00:20:44.042 --> 00:20:45.386
This is a problem.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.921
At this rate, Ran will be like this forever.

00:20:46.945 --> 00:20:47.422
| like the old Ran too.
At this rate, Ran will be like this forever.

00:20:47.446 --> 00:20:48.607
| like the old Ran too.

00:20:50.549 --> 00:20:54.008
Take this, and this, and this!
Give back Sis! Sayo Hits!

00:20:54.419 --> 00:20:57.565
Sure she got mad easily and
she wasn't good at school

00:20:57.589 --> 00:20:59.734
and she went through
money like crazy,

00:20:59.758 --> 00:21:03.194
but I loved Sis the way she always
was, an energetic gal!

00:21:04.496 --> 00:21:06.074
| haven't the slightest...

00:21:06.098 --> 00:21:07.827
Don't cry, Sayo-ppe.

00:21:09.067 --> 00:21:10.762
| understand, dear Sayo.

00:21:12.404 --> 00:21:13.894
Three...

00:21:14.773 --> 00:21:16.366
Two...

00:21:16.775 --> 00:21:17.819
One...

00:21:17.843 --> 00:21:18.503
<i>Zero!</i>

00:21:26.485 --> 00:21:27.395
Sis?!

00:21:27.419 --> 00:21:27.829
Ran!

00:21:27.853 --> 00:21:28.930
Ran!
Ran!

00:21:28.954 --> 00:21:30.649
What's everyone doing here?

00:21:31.123 --> 00:21:32.300
What the hell is this dress?!

00:21:32.324 --> 00:21:33.901
Some kind of costume contest
or something?!

00:21:33.925 --> 00:21:36.004
Ran! You're back!

00:21:36.028 --> 00:21:39.407
That shock must have severed the
telepathic connection with the aliens.

00:21:39.431 --> 00:21:41.160
Ook! Huge success!

00:21:41.566 --> 00:21:43.500
Don't you remember anything?

00:21:44.569 --> 00:21:46.936
Me, me, me, me, me, me, me!

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.484
<i>Thank goodness, chu!</i>

00:21:49.508 --> 00:21:49.717
<i>Case closed!
Thank goodness, chut!</i>

00:21:49.741 --> 00:21:51.486
Case closed!

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:52.477
Huh?

00:21:56.148 --> 00:21:58.526
Like hell something that weird
could ever happen.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:00.561
But it's true.

00:22:00.585 --> 00:22:02.630
You can't believe it, even seeing that dress?

00:22:02.654 --> 00:22:04.599
Anyway, I'm starving.

00:22:04.623 --> 00:22:07.149
And there's this burning
sensation in my mouth.

00:22:07.526 --> 00:22:10.004
We're super-out of money
because of the taxi fares.

00:22:10.028 --> 00:22:11.639
Second Place and Otohata
went home already,

00:22:11.663 --> 00:22:12.740
so why don't you give up for today?

00:22:12.764 --> 00:22:14.175
How heartless can you be?!

00:22:14.199 --> 00:22:16.177
Just one little drumstick?

00:22:16.201 --> 00:22:18.169
Oh, fine.

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:21.082
Congratulations!

00:22:21.106 --> 00:22:23.685
For our 100,000th customer,

00:22:23.709 --> 00:22:26.154
we have all-you-can-eat fried chicken!

00:22:26.178 --> 00:22:27.822
For real?!

00:22:27.846 --> 00:22:29.357
Woo-hoo!

00:22:29.381 --> 00:22:29.390
Celebrate 100,000th Customer
All-You-Can-Eat Woo-hoo!

00:22:29.414 --> 00:22:31.092
Celebrate 100,000th
Customer All-You-Can-Eat

00:22:31.116 --> 00:22:32.327
Celebrate 100,000th Customer
All-You-Can-Eat Are you okay?

00:22:32.351 --> 00:22:34.395
Celebrate 100,000th Customer All-You-Can-Eat
That face... She's totally gone.

00:22:34.419 --> 00:22:35.352
Celebrate 100,000th
Customer All-You-Can-Eat

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:42.103
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:42.127 --> 00:22:48.328
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.767 --> 00:22:55.083
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:55.107 --> 00:23:00.375
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.346 --> 00:23:07.628
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.652 --> 00:23:13.421
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.992 --> 00:23:20.308
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.332 --> 00:23:26.013
| want to become friends with you

00:23:26.037 --> 00:23:31.999
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.377 --> 00:23:37.992
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:38.016 --> 00:23:45.533
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.557 --> 00:23:51.472
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.496 --> 00:23:58.146
If only I had more courage

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:04.576
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.444 --> 00:24:06.721
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.745 --> 00:24:08.356
Next Super GALS!
Wandering around Shibuya, lost and scared,

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:09.357
Next Super GALS!
lonely all by herself, country girl!

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:09.891
lonely all by herself, country girl!

00:24:09.915 --> 00:24:11.626
Her name is Maki Komine!

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.428
From a northern land where snow
hinders passage in the winter,

00:24:13.452 --> 00:24:15.596
she's come to ask me to
make her my disciple!

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:17.598
Why the heck do you want to be
my disciple anyway?

00:24:17.622 --> 00:24:18.399
What's this?

00:24:18.423 --> 00:24:20.768
Best sense of fashion, awesome
sensibilities, perfect style!

00:24:20.792 --> 00:24:24.439
Because the great Ran Kotobuki is the
number one super gal in Shibuya!

00:24:24.463 --> 00:24:27.475
Oh, fine, I'll make an exception
and make you my disciple!

